## Code Example

```javascript
function deltaSize(prev, curr) {
  const delta = {};
  for (const k of Object.keys(curr)) {
    delta[k] = Math.max(0, (curr[k] || 0) - (prev[k] || 0));
  }
  return delta;
}
```

